amnezia-wg-macos - license notice
==================================

This repository aggregates and patches two upstream projects. Each component
keeps its own license; nothing here relicenses upstream code.

  - src/amneziawg-go      - MIT (WireGuard LLC).  See src/amneziawg-go/LICENSE
  - src/amneziawg-tools   - GPL-2.0.              See src/amneziawg-tools/COPYING

The only modification made by this repository is a patch to the macOS bring-up
script:

  src/amneziawg-tools/src/wg-quick/darwin.bash

That file is part of amneziawg-tools and therefore remains under **GPL-2.0**.
The patch (socket-directory alignment to /var/run/amneziawg and wg->awg call
rename) is likewise released under GPL-2.0.

The Makefile, README.md, docs/, and config examples in this repository are
released under GPL-2.0 as well.

All original copyrights are retained by their respective owners.
